# Best-effort reserved names for vendor bundled/system skills.
# Format: agent skill-name
#
# Last Claude Code bundled-skill documentation check: 2026-08-14
# Sources:
#   https://code.claude.com/docs/en/commands  (rows marked Skill)
#   https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills
# If that date is more than 30 days ago, refresh the Claude rows from those
# pages before other work, then set the date to today.
#
# Cursor names are also discovered from ~/.cursor/skills-cursor at install time.
# Codex system names are also discovered from $CODEX_HOME/skills/.system and
# /etc/codex/skills when those directories exist.

claude batch
claude claude-api
claude code-review
claude dataviz
claude debug
claude design-sync
claude doctor
claude fewer-permission-prompts
claude loop
claude review
claude run
claude run-skill-generator
claude simplify
claude skill-creator
claude verify

cursor automate
cursor autopilot
cursor canvas
cursor create-hook
cursor create-rule
cursor create-skill
cursor create-subagent
cursor loop
cursor migrate-to-skills
cursor onboard
cursor rename-chat
cursor review
